# Voracious Varmint: "Destroy target artifact or enchantment" (CR 115.1). Bot2 has a Fastbond (enchantment), an Elvish Mystic (creature, no
# artifact) and a Forest; Bot1 has the Varmint (a creature) and a Forest. Neither creature nor either land is a target (refused); Bot2's
# Fastbond, an enchantment it controls, is, and is destroyed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Voracious Varmint
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Fastbond
Forest x20

